# This file governs the `frontend` build only. Both services now use the repo
# root as their build context (docker-compose.yml), so everything below would
# otherwise be shipped to the Docker daemon on every build. The frontend image
# only needs QT_FrontEnd/, codex/ and shared/.
#
# The `api` service builds from the root too, but it needs QT_API/ (excluded
# here), so it carries its own ignore list at
# "QT_API/Quintessence Website/Dockerfile.dockerignore". BuildKit prefers a
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore over this file for that build. Keep the two in sync
# when adding an exclusion that applies to both.

# The API is not part of the frontend build.
QT_API/
**/appsettings.Production.json
.env

# Runtime data and uploads (server-side only, never built)
**/App_Data/
**/uploads/

# Dependencies and build output - reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# TLS material - Cloudflare terminates TLS, nothing here needs certs
**/ssl/
*.pem
*.key

# Tooling / editor noise
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
**/*.user
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Docs - not needed to build either frontend
*.md
